<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EZR" style="id">- Selee Old Testament</book>
  <para style="h">ESRA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Esra Kukũ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Esra</para>
  <para style="toc3">Esr</para>
  <para style="mt1">ESRA</para>
  <para style="mt2">KUKŨ</para>
  <para style="imt">ODIKI OTUO</para>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bk">Esra Kukũ</char> nle <char style="bk">Kronika</char>, Akũ sitũ ɔkyɛ sɛlaa. Diotuo ni mmle di Yuda batii ba bawo niasiɛ ni di sɛlanle kamɛ di Babel kasɔ lakple baawa ni ku nkpa ku kasumu lese lɛbla di Yerusalem. Bɛɛtɛ sɛsaabla se mmle fɛ mmle sitikanko ni bawo kanya: (1) Yuda batii dikudi kasale le niapɛbaakple ni di Babel kasɔ sɛlanle kamɛ di Persia batii ɔka Kores sɛlɔ didiki kanya. (2) Baase Olekatakɔ nwu letofo, baakleklesa ni, ni baakple baase Yaa otoosumu di Yerusalem nɛ; (3) Di alɛɛ awo sɛmaa, Yuda batii dikudi bamba lakple baasifi Yerusalem di Esra laleko ma ni katũ. Esra lale otii wɔ niatofo ni Yaa Kufiofa kamɛ nwaa, ankyakaako ni batii manse ni kasumu ku nkpa lɛma disiɛbi ose lɛbla di mmle diale ni kɔba lekpee ninta ni ninwuna kamɛ atesaa ole di Israel.</para>
  <para style="iot">Kukũ Nwu Kamɛ Sɛlaa</para>
  <para style="io1">Sɛlanle kamɛ odie okple osifi lɛkasale <char style="ior">1.1-2.70</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Baase Olekatakɔ letofo baakleklesa ni kafɔɔ <char style="ior">3.1-6.22</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Esra ku balanle bamba okple osifi Yerusalem <char style="ior">7.1-10.44</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EZR 1" />
  <para style="s1">Kores Ladiki Yuda Batii Kanya Alɛ Bapɛbakple Basifi Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 1:1" />Di Persia ɔka Kores lɛlɛɛ kasale kamɛ, di mmle di SAATE nwu ɔlaa wɔ di Yeremia labuɛ ni kaawa ni kaanya oso yi, SAATE nwu lakpanko Persia ɔka Kores otu alɛ ayie lɛkya di sɛka kalekɔ nɔɔ kamuu kamɛ, aakpana nwu kafɔɔ di kukũ kamɛ alɛ:<verse eid="EZR 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 1:2" />Nkpo di Persia ɔka Kores kobuɛ nɛ, alɛ:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="EZR 1:2">SAATE nwu, Yaa wɔ ninkpe ni di osi ntɔɔyɔ sɛka nlekɔ be mmuu di kasɔ suoto ɛɛtɛɛ, ni eediki mi alɛ ntofo olekatakɔ ntɔɔ di Yerusalem di Yuda nɛ. <verse eid="EZR 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 1:3" />Batii nɔɔ lele ninsi di kamɛ lee yi- Yaa nɔɔ asiɛko nwɔ, aatɔɔ akata akyɛ Yerusalem di Yuda aalaatofo SAATE nwu olekatakɔ, Israel Yaa nwu, Yaa wɔ ninkpe ni di Yerusalem. <verse eid="EZR 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 1:4" />Di batii ba di lɛba lele di mba niebu basi ni nkpa nsi ni nunua batɔɔ koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle, ku asaa, babɔkɛɛ sele, ku otu-fãa asaaɔta diɛta ni Yaa olekatakɔ nwu di Yerusalem.<verse eid="EZR 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 1:5" />Ninfɛ di Yuda ku Benyamin nfaabi banɔɔfo, ku olebatatɛ ku Lewi batii- otii biala di Yaa lakpanko ni di otu- lalolaa suoto aakata akyɛ aalaatofo SAATE nwu leyo di Yerusalem nɛ. <verse eid="EZR 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 1:6" />Mba niasiɛ baakaako ma ni bamuu lakyakaako ma ku koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle awansaa, ku asaa ku babɔkɛɛ sele ku akyɛsaa ya niefũ ni kɔya, di otu-fãa asaaɔta amuu nkyakaa nii. <verse eid="EZR 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 1:7" />Diɛkyakaa nii, ɔka Kores ladieko awansaa ya niale ni SAATE nwu olekatakɔ ale, n-ya di ɔka Nebukadnesar layɔ aadieko ni di Yerusalem aayɔ aalaatɛ ni di bayaa nɔɔ olekatakɔ. <verse eid="EZR 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 1:8" />Ni di Persia ɔka Kores lata Mitredat, otii wɔ nintɛ ni ato layɔ asaa nwu aawako, aabaka nya aata Yuda ɔnɔɔfo Sesbasar nɛ.<verse eid="EZR 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 1:9" />Asaa nwu niale n-ya mmle nɛ:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 1:9" />
  <table>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">koto sɛɛle akaku</cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">afosi-atiɛ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">koto fututu akaku </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">kakpe kanwii</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">koto fututu babɛɛsi </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">afosi-anyɔ banaasĩ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 1:9" />
        <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 1:10" />koto sɛɛle abɛɛsibii</cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">afosi-atiɛ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">koto fututu abɛɛsibii kaatɛɛle </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">alafa-ana-lefosi</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">awansaa bamba </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">kakpe kanwii</cell>
    </row>
  </table>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 1:10">
    <verse eid="EZR 1:10" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 1:11" />Koto sɛɛle ku koto fututu nwu awansaa amuu labla nkpe-nnɔɔ-alafa-ana. Sesbasar layɔ asaa ya mmle amuu aawako di obe wɔ di balanle nwu lakye Babel kasɔ baawa ni Yerusalem.<verse eid="EZR 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EZR 2" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda Batii Balanle Ba Niakple Baasifi Ni Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 2:1" />Nnya kasɔ nwu batii ba niadie ni di sɛlanle kamɛ baawa ni Yerusalem, mba di Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar lakpaa aasifiko ni sɛlanle kamɛ di Babel kasɔ (baapɛbaakple baasifi ni Yerusalem ku Yuda, otii biala lasifi okpoo nɔɔ omu, <verse eid="EZR 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 2:2" />manko mba mmle niapɛbaakple baawa nɛ, Serubabel, Yesua, Nehemia, Seraia, Reelaia, Mordekai, Bilsan, Mispar, Bigwai, Rehum ku Baana):</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 2:2" />
  <para style="mi" vid="EZR 2:2">Israel batii basuɔtɔ lɛpɔ niale nle mmle nɛ:<verse eid="EZR 2:2" /></para>
  <table>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 2:3" />Paros banantii: </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Nkpe nnyɔ- kɔlafa- afosi-akuɛnsĩ-banyɔ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:3" />
        <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 2:4" />Sefatia banantii: </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Alafa atiɛ- afosi-akuɛnsĩ-banyɔ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:4" />
        <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 2:5" />Ara banantii: </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Alafa akuɛnsĩ-afosi- akuɛnsĩ-banɔɔ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:5" />
        <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 2:6" />Pahat-Moab banantii (baafe ni di Yesua ku Yoab suoto) </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Nkpe nnyɔ-alafa-anɛ-lefosi-banyɔ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:6" />
        <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 2:7" />Elam banantii: </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Kakpe alafa anyɔ-afosi-anɔɔ -bana</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:7" />
        <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 2:8" />Satu banantii: </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Alafa anaasĩ-afosi ana-banɔɔ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:8" />
        <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 2:9" />Sakai banantii: </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Alafa akuɛnsĩ-afosi-akuɔ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:9" />
        <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 2:10" />Bani banantii: </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Alafa akuɔ-afosi-ana-banyɔ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:10" />
        <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 2:11" />Bebai banantii: </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Alafa akuɔ-afosi-anyɔ-batiɛ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:11" />
        <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 2:12" />Asgad banantii: </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Kakpe alafa-anyɔ- afosi-anyɔ-banyɔ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:12" />
        <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 2:13" />Adonikam banantii: </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Alafa akuɔ-afosi -akuɔ-bakuɔ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:13" />
        <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 2:14" />Bigwai banantii: </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Nkpe nnyɔ-afosi-anɔɔ-bakuɔ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:14" />
        <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 2:15" />Adin banantii: </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Alafa ana-afosi-anɔɔ-bana</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:15" />
        <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 2:16" />Ater banantii (baafe ni di Hesekia suoto): </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Afosi-anaasĩ-banɛ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:16" />
        <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 2:17" />Besai banantii: </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Alafa atiɛ-afosi-anyɔ- batiɛ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:17" />
        <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 2:18" />Yora banantii: </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Kɔlafa-lefosi-banyɔ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:18" />
        <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 2:19" />Hasum banantii: </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Alafa-anyɔ afosi-anyɔ-batiɛ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:19" />
        <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 2:20" />Gibar banantii: </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Afosi-anaasĩ-banɔɔ</cell>
    </row>
  </table>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 2:20">
    <verse eid="EZR 2:20" />
  </para>
  <table>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 2:21" />Betlehem batii: </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Kɔlafa-afosi-anyɔ-batiɛ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:21" />
        <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 2:22" />Netofa batii: </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Afosi-anɔɔ-bakuɔ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:22" />
        <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 2:23" />Anatot batii: </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Kɔlafa-afosi- anyɔ-banɛ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:23" />
        <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 2:24" />Asmawet batii: </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Afosi-ana-banyɔ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:24" />
        <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 2:25" />Kiriat Yearim, Kefira ku Beerot batii: </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Alafa- akuɛnsĩ-afosi ana-batiɛ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:25" />
        <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 2:26" />Rama ku Giba batii: </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Alafa-akuɔ-afosi-anyɔ-onwii</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:26" />
        <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 2:27" />Mikmas batii: </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Kɔlafa-afosi-anyɔ-banyɔ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:27" />
        <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 2:28" />Betel ku Ai batii: </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Alafa-anyɔ-afosi-anyɔ-batiɛ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:28" />
        <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 2:29" />Nebo batii: </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Afosi-anɔɔ-banyɔ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:29" />
        <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 2:30" />Magbis batii: </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Kɔlafa-afosi-anɔɔ-bakuɔ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:30" />
        <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 2:31" />Elam bamba batii: </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Kakpe-alafa anyɔ-afosi-anɔɔ -bana</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:31" />
        <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 2:32" />Harim batii: </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Alafa-atiɛ-afosi-anyɔ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:32" />
        <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 2:33" />Lod, Hadid ku Ono batii: </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Alafa-akuɛnsĩ-afosi- anyɔ-banɔɔ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:33" />
        <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 2:34" />Yeriko batii: </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Alafa-atiɛ- afosi-ana-banɔɔ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:34" />
        <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 2:35" />Senaa batii: </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Nkpe ntiɛ-alafa-akuɔ-afosi-atiɛ</cell>
    </row>
  </table>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 2:35">
    <verse eid="EZR 2:35" />
  </para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 2:36" />Olebatatɛ niale:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 2:36" />
  <table>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">Yedaia banantii: (baafe ni di Yesua leyo kamɛ suoto)</cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Alafa-anaasĩ-afosi-akuɛnsĩ-batiɛ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:36" />
        <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZR 2:37" />Imer banantii: </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Kakpe-afosi- anɔɔ-banyɔ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:37" />
        <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZR 2:38" />Pashur banantii: </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Kakpe-alafa-anyɔ-afosi-ana-bakuɛnsĩ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:38" />
        <verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZR 2:39" />Harim banantii: </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Kakpe-lefosi-bakuɛnsĩ</cell>
    </row>
  </table>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 2:39">
    <verse eid="EZR 2:39" />
  </para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZR 2:40" />Lewi Batii niale:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 2:40" />
  <table>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">Yesua ku Kadmiel banantii: (baafe ni di Hodawia kɔna suoto) </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Afosi- akuɛnsĩ-bana</cell>
    </row>
  </table>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 2:40">
    <verse eid="EZR 2:40" />
  </para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZR 2:41" />Sinu basantɛ:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 2:41" />
  <table>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">Asaf banantii: </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Kɔlafa-afosi-anyɔ-banɛ</cell>
    </row>
  </table>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 2:41">
    <verse eid="EZR 2:41" />
  </para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZR 2:42" />Olekatakɔ n-yoko banyuntɛ:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 2:42" />
  <table>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">Salum, Ater, Talmon,</cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end" />
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">Akub, Hatita ku Sobai</cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end" />
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">banantii: </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Kɔlafa-afosi-atiɛ-banansĩ</cell>
    </row>
  </table>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 2:42">
    <verse eid="EZR 2:42" />
  </para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZR 2:43" />Olekatakɔ nwu bakpɛmblatɛ:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 2:43" />
  <table>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">Banantii nwu niale</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">Siha, Hasufa, Tabaot,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:43" />
        <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZR 2:44" />Keros, Siaha, Padon,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:44" />
        <verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZR 2:45" />Lebana, Hagaba, Akub,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:45" />
        <verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZR 2:46" />Hagab, Slamai, Hanan,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:46" />
        <verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZR 2:47" />Gidel, Gahar, Reaia,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:47" />
        <verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZR 2:48" />Resin, Nekoda, Gasam,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:48" />
        <verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZR 2:49" />Usa, Pasea, Besai,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:49" />
        <verse number="50" style="v" sid="EZR 2:50" />Asna, Meuni, Nefisi,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:50" />
        <verse number="51" style="v" sid="EZR 2:51" />Bakbuk, Hakufa, Harhu,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:51" />
        <verse number="52" style="v" sid="EZR 2:52" />Baslut, Mehida, Harsa,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:52" />
        <verse number="53" style="v" sid="EZR 2:53" />Barkos, Sisera, Temah,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:53" />
        <verse number="54" style="v" sid="EZR 2:54" />Nesia ku Hatifa</cell>
    </row>
  </table>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 2:54">
    <verse eid="EZR 2:54" />
  </para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="EZR 2:55" />Solomon bakpɛmblatɛ banantii:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 2:55" />
  <table>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">niale</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">Sotai, Soferet, Peruda,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:55" />
        <verse number="56" style="v" sid="EZR 2:56" />Yaala, Darkon, Gidel,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="EZR 2:56" />
        <verse number="57" style="v" sid="EZR 2:57" />Sefatia, Hatil,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">Pokeret-Hasebaim ku Ami banantii nɛ.</cell>
    </row>
  </table>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 2:57">
    <verse eid="EZR 2:57" />
  </para>
  <table>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse number="58" style="v" sid="EZR 2:58" />Olekatakɔ nwu bakpɛmblatɛ ku Solomon bakpɛmblatɛ banantii: </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Alafa-atiɛ-afosi-anaasĩ-banyɔ.</cell>
    </row>
  </table>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 2:58">
    <verse eid="EZR 2:58" />
  </para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="EZR 2:59" />Batii ba mmle niakye Tel-Mela, Tel-Harsa, Kerub, Adon ku Imer sekpoo nɛ, kafɔɔ batafuo otuo alɛ ayo lɛma kamɛ batii lakye Israel:<verse eid="EZR 2:59" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <table>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse number="60" style="v" sid="EZR 2:60" />Delaia, Tobia </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end" />
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">ku Nekoda banantii</cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">Alafa-akuɔ-afosi-anɔɔ banyɔ.</cell>
    </row>
  </table>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 2:60">
    <verse eid="EZR 2:60" />
  </para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="EZR 2:61" />Ku mba niakye ni olebatatɛ kamɛ:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 2:61" />
  <table>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">Hobaia, Hakos ku Barsilai banantii</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">(osuɔtɔ wɔ niayɔ ni Barsilai obisankobi Gilead otii nwu baatɔɔlɛɛ ku leyooto nwu nkpo nɛ).</cell>
    </row>
  </table>
  <para style="pi1" vid="EZR 2:61">
    <verse eid="EZR 2:61" />
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="EZR 2:62" />Batii ba mmle lawolaa ayooto lɛma di leyo lɛma akũ kamɛ, kafɔɔ batanya nya, nioso badiki ma di olebatatɛ sɛsaabla kamɛ, fɛ batii ba ninanklekle nii. <verse eid="EZR 2:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="EZR 2:63" />Abaa kanyayilatɛ latɔkɔ ma alɛ batanle alesaa ya nieklekle alenke ni kuninwii dialaase di obe wɔ baawɛ ni oletatɛ wɔ nin-yɛ ɔɔbla ni ɔkpɛ ku Urim ku Tumim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.63</char><char style="ft" closed="false">nnya niale asaa anyɔ ya di olebatatɛ layɔ baatoowolaa ni Yaa dibiesaa kamɛ nɛ</char></note>.<verse eid="EZR 2:63" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="EZR 2:64" />Dikudi nwu nimmuu lɛpɔ labla batii nkpe afosi-ana-nkpe-nnyɔ, alafa-atiɛ-afosi-akuɔ, <verse eid="EZR 2:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="EZR 2:65" />di bakpɛmblatɛ-suɔtɔ ku bakpɛmblatɛ-sanko lɛma nkpe nkuɛnsĩ, alafa-atiɛ-afosi-atiɛ-bakuɛnsĩ diesi ni kaamɛ nɛ; ni baawɛ sinu basantɛ basuɔtɔ ku basanko alafa-anyɔ kafɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="EZR 2:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="EZR 2:66" />Baawɛ bapɔnkɔ alafa-akuɛnsĩ-afosi-atiɛ-bakuɔ, babɔkɛɛ ba nite ni fɛ bapɔnkɔ alafa-anyɔ-afosi-ana-banɔɔ, <verse eid="EZR 2:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="EZR 2:67" />kapubapɔnkɔ alafa-ana-afosi-atiɛ-banɔɔ ku bapɔnkɔ ba nintuka ni atoo nkpe-nkuɔ, alafa-akuɛnsĩ-afosi-anyɔ.<verse eid="EZR 2:67" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="EZR 2:68" />Di obe wɔ baalaabuo ni SAATE nwu leyo di Yerusalem yi, ayo nwu kamɛ banɔɔfo bawo lata asaaɔta ku otu-fãa diata ni Yaa leyo ose letofo di katofokɔ nini. <verse eid="EZR 2:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="EZR 2:69" />Baata koto katɛkɔ nwu koto sɛɛle bakilo alafa anɔɔ, koto fututu bakilo nkpe nnyɔ alafa-anɛ ku olebatatɛ akpeele kɔlafa diɛta ni ɔkpɛ nwu di mmle di ɔnyɛɛ lɛma late ni kanya.<verse eid="EZR 2:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="EZR 2:70" />Olebatatɛ, Lewi batii, sinu basantɛ, n-yoko banyuntɛ ku olekatakɔ bakpɛmblatɛ nwu lasiɛ di sekpoo lɛma simu kamɛ, ku batii bamba bawo, ni di Israel batii bule lasiɛ di sekpoo lɛma kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="EZR 2:70" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EZR 3" />
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Kasumu Lakple Kaakye Kasɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 3:1" />Di kɔwɛntɛ kuɛnsinle layie ni di Israel batii lasiɛ ni di sekpoo lɛma kamɛ yi, batii nwu lasi fɛ otii onwii di Yerusalem. <verse eid="EZR 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 3:2" />Ninfɛ di Yosadak obisuɔtɔbi Yesua ku olebatatɛ wo nɔɔ ku Seatiel obisuɔtɔbi Serubabel ku bawo nɔɔ lakyekasɔ baatootofo Israel Yaa nwu oleɔta akyikye alɛ baata ofiɛ asaaɔta ninnya suoto nɛ, di mmle kanya bɛɛkpana beekpee ni di Yaa otii nwu, Mose Afiofa kamɛ. <verse eid="EZR 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 3:3" />Nu baatɔɔyɛkɛ batii ba niasiɛ baamana ma baakyi ni yi, baatofo oleɔta akyikye nwu di lɛsɔse nini, ni baata ofiɛ asaaɔta ninnya suoto baata SAATE nwu, olesɛ ku kɔtɔɔfɔ oleɔta nɛ. <verse eid="EZR 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 3:4" />Ninfɛ baale Akpanta Dii nwu ku ofiɛ asaaɔta di lɛpɔ le diakaatɛɛ diɛta ni dii biala fɛ mmle bɛɛkpana bɛɛtɛ ni kanya nɛ. <verse eid="EZR 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 3:5" />Nninkpo sɛmaa, baata obe lele ofiɛ asaaɔta, Kɔwɛntɛ Fɔle oleɔta ku SAATE nwu ayi klekle ole nwu omuu wɔ baatɛ ni ku n-ya baawako ni fɛ otu-fãa asaaɔta baata ni SAATE nwu. <verse eid="EZR 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 3:6" />Di kɔwɛntɛ kuɛnsinle dii kasale suoto yi, baakyekasɔ batɔɔta ofiɛ asaaɔta baatɔɔta SAATE nwu, nu manadise SAATE nwu olekatakɔ lɛsɔse.<verse eid="EZR 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Olekatakɔ Nwu Ose Letofo Lakyekasɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 3:7" />Ninfɛ baata ayo batofotɛ ku asaa bawolatɛ koto, baata kafɔɔ Sidon batii ku Tiro batii alesaa, anyinsaa ku nnɔnyi, di mmle baakyeko ni sedar awosokuu di Lebanon di lekpo osi manwako ni Yopa, fɛ mmle di Persia ɔka Kores lata ni osuku nɛ. <verse eid="EZR 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 3:8" />Di kɔwɛntɛ nyɔɔfa di lɛlɛɛ nyɔɔfa kamɛ di Yaa leyo obuo lɛma sɛmaa di Yerusalem yi, Seatiel obisuɔtɔbi Serubabel, Yosadak obisuɔtɔbi Yesua ku babilɛma-suɔtɔbi bule (olebatatɛ ku Lewi batii ku mba bamuu niakye ni sɛlanle kamɛ baawa ni Yerusalem) lakye ɔkpɛ nwu kasɔ. Baadiki Lewi batii ba nintofũ ni alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ ku mba nintoobe balenke ni baase kaanya alɛ batoonyu SAATE nwu leyo otofo. <verse eid="EZR 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 3:9" />Ni di Yesua ku babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ ku babilɛma-suɔtɔbi ku Kadmiel ku babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ (Hodawia banantii) ku Henadad babisuɔtɔbi ku basuɔtɔbi lɛma- di bamuu lɛma bale ni Lewi batii- labla onwii batoonyu batii ba niatɔɔbla ni ɔkpɛ di Yaa leyo nwu suoto nɛ.<verse eid="EZR 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 3:10" />Obe wɔ di ayo batofotɛ nwu lase ni SAATE nwu olekatakɔ lɛsɔse yi, olebatatɛ nwu lakpee akpeele lɛma baaklee akyikyoo, Lewi batii nwu kafɔɔ (Asaf babisuɔtɔbi) laklee abɔɔsaa anɛɛkya, baabayila ninfa baatɔɔtansa SAATE nwu, fɛ mmle di Israel ɔka Dawid latuo nii. <verse eid="EZR 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 3:11" />Baasa katansa ku sɛfa ɔpɛ sinu baata SAATE nwu alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZR 3:11">SAATE nwu nlɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZR 3:11">lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ le akpe ata ni Israel nnaa kaloo.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZR 3:11">Ni di batii nwu bamuu layiisa katansa kudú kplɛ baata SAATE nwu nɛ, diekye batoose SAATE nwu leyo lɛsɔse. <verse eid="EZR 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 3:12" />Kafɔɔ olebatatɛ nɔɔfole ku Lewi batii ku ayo kamɛ banɔɔfo ba nianya ni olekatakɔ kofole nwu lawi kaku osie kanya, di obe wɔ baanya ni mmle boose ni olekatakɔ nwu lɛsɔse, di batii kpinwu bawo layiisa ni suoto lɛyɔɔ kudú. <verse eid="EZR 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 3:13" />Kuonwii ditafuo suoto lɛyɔɔ kudú sɛlɔ ku kaku owi kudú sɛlɔ otofo, diekye batii nwu latooyiisa kudú osie kanya. Ni baanu kudú sɛlɔ nwu di kakyonkɔ nɛ.<verse eid="EZR 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EZR 4" />
  <para style="s1">Batii Lataka Baayila Di Olekatakɔ Nwu Ose Letofo Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 4:1" />Obe wɔ di Yuda ku Benyamin balo lanu alɛ balanle nwu nfɛ kotofo ni olekatakɔ manta ni SAATE, Israel Yaa nwu yi, <verse eid="EZR 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 4:2" />baawa Serubabel ku ayo kamɛ banɔɔfo nfũ baatɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Bita bukyakaako ye bietofo, diekye, fɛle aye okle yi, munsumu Yaa lee nwu, muntɔɔta oleɔta kafɔɔ muntɔtɔɔ, diayɔ ni di Asiria ɔka Esarhadon obe kamɛ, nnwɔ niakpaa wo aawako ni nfũ.”<verse eid="EZR 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 4:3" />Kafɔɔ Serubabel, Yesua ku Israel ayo kamɛ banɔɔfo nwu bule ladiki kanya alɛ, “Binaa kablakɔ kukanwii ku awo di olekatakɔ nwu otofo ɔta Yaa loo. Leteloo bubatofo ni munta SAATE, Israel Yaa nwu, fɛ mmle di Persia ɔka, Ɔka Kores latɔkɔ wo nii.”<verse eid="EZR 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 4:4" />Ni di batii ba niamana ma baakyi ni ladie baakyɛ baalafefeesa Yuda batii nnɛɛ, baakpee ma lɛyɛkɛ ku olekatakɔ nwu otofo nɛ. <verse eid="EZR 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 4:5" />Baata asibubatatɛ koto alɛ bayila ma di suoto baakpɔkpɔtɔsa asibu lɛma ɔkpɛ di Persia ɔka Kores sɛka ole simuu kamɛ dialaase ni di Persia ɔka Dario sɛka ole kamɛ.<verse eid="EZR 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔtaka Oyila Di Yerusalem Ose Letofo Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 4:6" />Di Akasweros sɛka ole kasɔ kakyekɔ yi, baabudi ɔlaa baatika di Yuda ku Yerusalem batii suoto.<verse eid="EZR 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 4:7" />Ninfɛ di Persia ɔka Artasasta obe kamɛ yi, Bislam, Mitredat, Tabeel ku bakyakaakotɛ lɛma lakpana kukũ baata Artasasta nɛ. Baakpana kukũ nwu di Siria kɔkpana kamɛ di Siria sele kamɛ.<verse eid="EZR 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 4:8" />Kakpɛ kanyayilatɛ Rehum ku kukũ kpanatɛ Simsai lakpana kukũ kuayila di Yerusalem suoto aata ɔka Artasasta fɛ mmle diɔwa nii:<verse eid="EZR 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 4:9" />Kakpɛ kanyayilatɛ Rehum ku kukũ kpanatɛ Simsai, diɛkyakaa ni di bakyakaakotɛ lɛma bule- bakantɛ ku kasɔ nwu banɔɔfotii ba niakye ni, Tripoli, Persia, Erek, Babel, Susa, Elam batii nwu, <verse eid="EZR 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 4:10" />ku batii bamba ba di ɔnɔɔfotii kplɛ ku dibu otii nwu Asnapar latososa aadiki ni baalasiɛ ni di Samaria okpoo kplɛ nwu ku aba bamba di Okle-Kamaa sekpoo.<verse eid="EZR 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 4:11" />(Nnya kukũ nwu kamɛ sɛlaa se baakyesee nwɔ ni.)</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 4:11">Kuokye ni bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ, Okle-Kamaa sekpoo batii nfũ,</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 4:11">Kuɔta ni ɔka Artasasta:<verse eid="EZR 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 4:12" />Ɔka atofo alɛ Yuda batii ba niakata baawa ni ɔkyɛ loo, baakye ni ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ ntoosifi Yerusalem bɛɛkyɛ boose ɔtaka oyila ku amumu okpoo kplɛ nwu letofo. Bookple manse seyoyiɛ nwu lese, manlolaa asɔse nwu kafɔɔ.<verse eid="EZR 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 4:13" />Diɛkyakaa nii, ɔka atofo alɛ nse beetofo okpoo kplɛ nwu beese seyoyiɛ nini kafɔɔ lese yi, akpooto, kɔsɔsĩ ee asaa osunsũ ato ɔta dilɔbasinwɛ nɛ, ni ɔka leyo ato ɔwɛ kafɔɔ kamawakasɔ. <verse eid="EZR 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 4:14" />Nunua bule ni bakpɛmblatɛ buɔta ni lɛkayo, ninankaatɛ alɛ buosiɛ buonyu bulɛ baayɔ dibu bata ni ɔka oso yi, nioso buokyesee kanya ka mmle bulɛ buɔta ɔka letofo nɛ, <verse eid="EZR 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 4:15" />di mmle baawowolaa ni akũ kamɛ di mba nintoole fɔ katũ beele ni sɛka bɛɛbafe ni suoto. Fabanya di akũ ya mmle kamɛ falɛ ɔtaka oyila okpoo kplɛ ninle okpoo wɔ mmle, mankpee ni baka ku nsɔ nwu batii kubuɛ. Batokopĩtɛ kasiɛkɔ diayɔ ni di saa obe kamɛ. Nkpo oso baawɔɔsa okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle nɛ. <verse eid="EZR 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 4:16" />Buɔta ɔka letofo bulɛ nse beetofo okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle beese kafɔɔ seyoyiɛ ninwu lese yi, lɛsalɛsaa kuninwii dilabasimbu fɔ di Okle-Kamaa.<verse eid="EZR 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 4:17" />Ninfɛ di ɔka nwu lakyesee kanya didiki ka mmle alɛ:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 4:17">Kalaadu kakpɛ kanyayilatɛ Rehum, kukũ kpanatɛ Simsai ku bakpɛmblatɛwo lɛma bule nwu ninsi ni di Samaria aba bamba di Okle-Kamaa:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 4:17">Kɔsɛsɛɛsa ye.<verse eid="EZR 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 4:18" />Batɔɔka kukũ ko biekyesee wo nii, beediki kasɔ kafɔɔ di anu nii. <verse eid="EZR 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 4:19" />Lata osuku baawowolaa asaa kamɛ, ni baanya alɛ diayɔ ni di saa yi, okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle lataka kuayila di baka suoto, kuale kafɔɔ batokopĩtɛ ku banunsientɛ kasiɛkɔ. <verse eid="EZR 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 4:20" />Yerusalem lawɛ baka siene baatoole ni sɛka di Okle-Kamaa kamuu suoto, ni baatɔɔta akpooto, kɔsɔsĩ ku asaa osunsũ ato ya manta ni abaa baatɔɔta ma nɛ. <verse eid="EZR 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 4:21" />Nioso bikpee batii ba mmle kufiofa baadiɛ ɔkpɛ nwu, alɛ balaasinse okpoo wɔ mmle ose letofo diɛlase di obe wɔ lɛta ni osuku. <verse eid="EZR 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 4:22" />Bilolaa binyu bilɛ biɛblako ɔlaa wɔ mmle ɔkpɛ. Obe oso buata osuku dikpilesaa le mmle mmuɔ, ninlalasa asaa di ɔka suoto?<verse eid="EZR 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 4:23" />Obe wɔ baaka ni Ɔka Artasasta kukũ nwu bata ni Rehum ku kukũ kpanatɛ Simsai ku bakpɛmblatɛwo lɛma yi, nfanwu baasifi Yuda batii nfũ di Yerusalem, baayɔ osie baata ma baadiɛ ɔkpɛ nwu ɔbla.<verse eid="EZR 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 4:24" />Nkpo oso baadiɛ Yaa leyo nwu ɔkpɛ di Yerusalem ɔbla dialaase di Persia ɔka Dario sɛka ole lɛlɛɛ nyɔɔfa kamɛ.<verse eid="EZR 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EZR 5" />
  <para style="s1">Tatenai Kukũ Ko Aakyesee Ni Dario</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 5:1" />Ninfɛ di ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Hagai ku ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Sakaria, Ido ɔnantii onwii labuɛ ɔlaa baatɛ baata Yuda batii nwu di Yuda ku Yerusalem di Israel Yaa, nnwɔ nikonyu ma ni leyooto kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="EZR 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 5:2" />Ninfɛ di Sealtiel obisuɔtɔbi Serubabel ku Yosadak obisuɔtɔbi Yesua lataka alɛ bɔɔbla ɔkpɛ manse Yaa leyo nwu letofo di Yerusalem nɛ. Ni di Yaa ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ nwu lawɛ ku mma, baatɔɔkyakaako ma nɛ.<verse eid="EZR 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 5:3" />Di obe nwu kamɛ, Okle-Kamaa kanyayilatɛ Tatenai ku Setar-Bosnai ku bakpɛmblatɛwo lɛma lakyɛ ɔkyɛ lɛma baalaakaalɛ ma alɛ, “Owe niɛta ye osuku alɛ biase olekatakɔ ka mmle ose letofo ku seyoyiɛ se mmle ose lelolaa?” <verse eid="EZR 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 5:4" />Baakaalɛ kafɔɔ alɛ, “Lɛ manlɛɛ basuɔtɔ ba nikotofo ni leyo le mmle?” <verse eid="EZR 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 5:5" />Kafɔɔ Yaa lɛma ninu latoonyu Yuda batii banɔɔfo nwu, nioso batayilasa ma dialaase di obe wɔ di kanya lafuo ni Dario odu ku kanya didiki ofũ di kukũ nɔɔ ɔkpana kamɛ.<verse eid="EZR 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 5:6" />Nnya kukũ ko di Okle-Kamaa batii abaa kanyayilatɛ Tatenai ku Setar-Bosnai ku bakpɛmblatɛwo lɛma, Okle-Kamaa banɔɔfotii lakyesee ni ɔka Dario. <verse eid="EZR 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 5:7" />Kanya ka baakyesee nwɔ ni ninle alɛ:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 5:7">“Ɔka Dario:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 5:7" />
  <para style="pmc" vid="EZR 5:7">“Atoko ɔkyɛ ole asiɛko fɔ.<verse eid="EZR 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 5:8" />“Ɔka atofo alɛ buakyɛ Yuda kale dikudi nwu Yaa kplɛ olekatakɔ nwu. Batii nwu kotofo olekatakɔ nwu ku afuɔ kplɛ, bootika sewoso di seyoyiɛ nwu suoto. Boonwini mambla ɔkpɛ nwu ku nnɛɛ lɛma mankyɛnko sitũ osie kanya.<verse eid="EZR 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 5:9" />“Buakaalɛ banɔɔfo nwu sɛlaa, ni buakaalɛ ma bulɛ, ‘Owe niediki ye osuku alɛ biase olekatakɔ ka mmle letofo, biekple biese seyoyiɛ se mmle leloaa?’ <verse eid="EZR 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 5:10" />Buakaalɛ ayooto lɛma, di mmle buakpana ni batunletɛ lɛma ayooto muntɛ munta fɔ ni letofo.<verse eid="EZR 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 5:11" />“Kanya didiki le baata wo ni ninle alɛ:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 5:11" />
  <para style="pm" vid="EZR 5:11">‘Osi ku kasɔ Yaa bakpɛmblatɛ bule, ni buose olekatakɔ ka baatofo ni di alɛɛ kpinwu ya nintɔbafe ni letofo nɛ, nle di Israel ɔka kplɛ onwii latofo aaloo nii. <verse eid="EZR 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 5:12" />Kafɔɔ ta bawa loo lakpee ni Yaa wɔ di osi ɔblɔ oso yi, ni aayɔ ma akpee di Babel ɔka Nebukadnasar, Kaldea otii nwu nnɛɛ nɛ, nnwɔ niabiɛ ni olekatakɔ ka mmle, aamufũ ma aasifiko ni Babel.<verse eid="EZR 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 5:13" />‘Kafɔɔ, di Babel ɔka Kores lɛlɛɛ kasale kamɛ yi, Ɔka Kores lakpee kufiofa alɛ base Yaa leyo nwu letofo. <verse eid="EZR 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 5:14" />Aadiki bia koto sɛɛle ku koto fututu awansaa nwu niale ni Yaa leyo ale di Babel olekatakɔ, n-ya di Nebukadnesar layɔ ni di Yerusalem olekatakɔ aawako ni olekatakɔ di Babel.</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="EZR 5:14">‘Ninfɛ di Ɔka Kores layɔ nya aata osuɔtɔ onwii baatɔɔlɛɛ ni Sesbasar nɛ, nnwɔ aase ni abaa kanyayilatɛ. <verse eid="EZR 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 5:15" />Ni aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, ‘Yɔ awansaa ya mmle falaase di olekatakɔ di Yerusalem. Faase Yaa leyo nwu kafɔɔ letofo di kasɔ nini suoto. <verse eid="EZR 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 5:16" />Nioso Sesbasar wɔ mmle lawa aabase Yaa leyo nwu asɔse di Yerusalem. Diayɔ ni di dii nwu diɛbase ni di nua bootofo ni, kafɔɔ badiloo.’<verse eid="EZR 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 5:17" />“Nioso nunua nse dilɛ diɛta afɔ ɔka yi, ni faata bawolaa di Babel baka akũ kamɛ baanyu nse nwaako Ɔka Kores lakpee kufiofa alɛ base Yaa leyo le mmle letofo di Yerusalem. Ni biɛta ɔka nwu akyesee wo disibu nɔɔ di ɔlaa wɔ mmle suoto.”<verse eid="EZR 5:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EZR 6" />
  <para style="s1">Baanya Ɔka Kores Kufiofa Kukũ Nwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 6:1" />Ni di Ɔka Dario ladiki osuku, ni baawowola akũ ya baatɛ ni di asaa katɛkɔ di Babel nɛ. <verse eid="EZR 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 6:2" />Baanya kukũ kunwii di Akbatana okpoo kplɛ katanikokɔ di Media kasɔ suoto, nnya nle baakpana baatika ni ninkũ suoto:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 6:2">“Bɛɛkpana bɛɛtɛ alɛ:<verse eid="EZR 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 6:3" />“Di Ɔka Kores lɛlɛɛ kasale kamɛ yi, ɔka nwu lakpee kufiofa di Yaa olekatakɔ nwu suoto di Yerusalem alɛ:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 6:3" />
  <para style="pm" vid="EZR 6:3">“Bita base olekatakɔ nwu letofo fɛ lɛba le baata ni seleɔta, biɛta base asɔse nini kafɔɔ. Lɛtaka nini dibla nkpaa afosi-anaasĩ, lɛblɛfɛ nini kafɔɔ dibla nkpaa afosi-anaasĩ, <verse eid="EZR 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 6:4" />ku afuɔ kplɛ sitika sitiɛ, ditika ninwii kafɔɔ dile sewoso. Koto ko baablako ni ɔkpɛ nwu kukye ɔka leyo koto lɛlakaa kamɛ. <verse eid="EZR 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 6:5" />Diɛkyakaa nii, Yaa leyo koto sɛɛle ku koto fututu awansaa ya di Nebukadnesar layɔ ni di olekatakɔ nwu di Yerusalem aawako ni Babel yi, bakplesa nya balaase di aba ninya di olekatakɔ nwu di Yerusalem; bayɔ nya base di Yaa leyo kamɛ.<verse eid="EZR 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔka Dario Lata Osuku Alɛ Ɔkpɛ Nwu Kukple Kutɔɔkyɛ Sitũ</para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 6:6" />“Nunua yi, Tatenai, Okle-Kɛmaa abaa kanyayilatɛ ku Setar-Bosnai ku aye kasɔ nwu banɔɔfotii-wo lɛma, biblasa suoto ninfa. <verse eid="EZR 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 6:7" />Bitankpee kanya di Yaa olekatakɔ ɔkpɛ wɔ mmle suoto. Bita Yuda batii abaa kanyayilatɛ ku Yuda batii banɔɔfotii base Yaa leyo le mmle letofo di kasɔ nini suoto.<verse eid="EZR 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 6:8" />“Diɛkyakaa nii, kokpee kufiofa di lɛsaa le biabla minta ni Yuda batii banɔɔfo ba mmle di Yaa leyo le mmle otofo kamɛ:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="EZR 6:8">“Bata koto ko di basuɔtɔ ba mmle kamablako ni ɔkpɛ kumuu bakyeko ɔka koto lɛlakaa kamɛ, kukye Okle-kamaa batii akpooto kamɛ, di mmle di ɔkpɛ nwu dilɔbayila ni. <verse eid="EZR 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 6:9" />Lɛsaa lele niefĩ- banankyue-abi-suɔtɔ, akunumuu, afosobi-suɔtɔ diɛta ni ofiɛ asaɔta ɛɛta ni Yaa wɔ di osi ku kamɔɔ, mmba, nta ku nnɔnyi, fɛ mmle di olebatatɛ di Yerusalem lɛkaalɛ nii- dikpenii biɛta ma dii biala, bitansĩ nya ɔta, <verse eid="EZR 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 6:10" />di mmle baafuo ni oleɔta wɔ nikobuo ni Yaa wɔ di osi anu ɔta, mampɛ ni ɔlaa kafɔɔ manta ni ɔka ku babi nɔɔ lɛ̀lɛ suoto.<verse eid="EZR 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 6:11" />“Diɛkyakaa nii, kokpee kufiofa nlɛ nse otii owo lɛkyɛlɛnsa ɔlaa wɔ mmle yi, baananfi owoso badiki di leyo nɔɔ suoto batakatɛsa nwɔ katoo basaka di kapiɔpiɔnkɔ nini suoto. Ta okpile wɔ mmle oso yi, bayɔ leyo nɔɔ babla atɛnkudi ya besiisa ni. <verse eid="EZR 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 6:12" />Yaa wɔ niɛta alɛ Leyooto nɔɔ dite ni ninfa, atakatɛ ɔka lele leekpomii ee batii ba nimatakatɛ kɔnɛɛ mankyɛlɛnsa ni kufiofa ko mmle ee manlalaasa ni olekatakɔ ka mmle di Yerusalem.</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="EZR 6:12">“Ami Dario niekpee kufiofa nwu. Bita balolaa kufiofa nwu bale nwaa.<verse eid="EZR 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baakleklesa Olekatakɔ Nwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 6:13" />Ni, ta kufiofa ko di Ɔka Dario lakyesee ni oso yi, Tatenai, Okle-kamaa abaa kanyayilatɛ, ku Setar-Bosnai ku bakpɛmblatɛwo lɛma lalolaa baabla di ɔlaa nwu suoto nwaa. <verse eid="EZR 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 6:14" />Nioso Yuda batii banɔɔfo lanwini baatootofo leyo nwu, baawɛ sitũ ɔkyɛ di Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Hagai ku Sakaria, Ido ɔnantii nwu lɛkya oyie kamɛ. Baaloo olekatakɔ nwu otofo di Israel Yaa kufiofa ku Persia baka, Kores, Dario ku Artasasta ɔlaa wɔ baabuɛ ni kanya. <verse eid="EZR 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 6:15" />Nioso baaloo olekatakɔ nwu otofo di kɔwɛntɛ ko di Yuda batii nlɛɛ ni alɛ Adar, dii tiɛfa suoto, di Ɔka Dario lɛlɛɛ kuɔnle kamɛ.<verse eid="EZR 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 6:16" />Ninfɛ di Israel batii- olebatatɛ, Lewi batii ku balanle nwu bule- lale Yaa leyo nwu okleklesa dii ku suoto lɛyɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="EZR 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 6:17" />Di Yaa leyo le mmle okleklesa suoto yi, baata banankyue-suɔtɔ kɔlafa, akunumuu alafa anyɔ, afosobi-suɔtɔ alafa ana, ni baayɔ ntiekpaa lefosi-nnyɔ baata okpile asaaɔta di Israel batii bamuu disi nɛ, Israel kafaabi biala onwii. <verse eid="EZR 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 6:18" />Ni baase olebatatɛ di nfaabi lɛma kanya ku Lewi batii di akudi lɛma kanya alɛ baabla ɔkpɛ manta Yaa di Yerusalem, fɛ mmle kanya bɛɛkpana beekpee ni di Mose Kukũ kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="EZR 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okpi Diisi Ofe Dii Ole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 6:19" />Di lefosi dii naafa di Yuda batii kɔwɛntɛ kasale kamɛ yi, balanle nwu lale Okpi Diisi Ofe dii nwu. <verse eid="EZR 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 6:20" />Olebatatɛ ku Lewi batii nwu lakleklesa suoto lɛma ni di bamuu lɛma baabla klekle nɛ. Ni di Lewi batii nwu lalo Okpi Diisi Ofe lefosobi baata balanle nwu bamuu, babilɛma-suɔtɔbi olebatatɛ nwu ku mma bamu suoto nɛ. <verse eid="EZR 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 6:21" />Nioso Israel batii ba niakye ni sɛlanle kamɛ baawa ni lale alesaa nwu, manko mba bamuu niablasa ni suoto lɛma di mba ninanle ni Yuda batii bakaako ma ni sɛsaabla lɛma se ninanklekle ni suoto di mmle baawolaa ni SAATE, Israel Yaa nwu. <verse eid="EZR 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 6:22" />Ayi akuɛnsĩ baale dii nwu ku Bloblo wɔ di Lɛnyankasaa diesi ni kaamɛ di suoto lɛyɔɔ kamɛ. Diekye SAATE nwu layɔ suoto lɛyɔɔ aakpee ma kaamɛ di mmle aakyɛlɛnsa ni Asiria ɔka nwu ablasaa, alɛ aakyakaako ma ni di Yaa leyo ɔkpɛ nwu ɔbla ɔta Israel Yaa nwu.<verse eid="EZR 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EZR 7" />
  <para style="s1">Esra Lalabuo Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 7:1" />Di asaa ya mmle sɛmaa, di Persia ɔka Artasasta sɛka ole kamɛ yi, Esra ote niale Seraia, di ote niale ni Asaria, aale ni Hilkia obisuɔtɔbi, <verse eid="EZR 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 7:2" />aale ni Salum obisuɔtɔbi, aale ni Sadok obisuɔtɔbi, aale ni Ahitub obisuɔtɔbi, <verse eid="EZR 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 7:3" />aale ni Amaria obisuɔtɔbi, aale ni Asaria obisuɔtɔbi, aale ni Meraiot obisuɔtɔbi, <verse eid="EZR 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 7:4" />aale ni Serahia obisuɔtɔbi, aale ni Usi obisuɔtɔbi, aale ni Buki obisuɔtɔbi, <verse eid="EZR 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 7:5" />aale ni Abisua obisuɔtɔbi, aale ni Pinehas obisuɔtɔbi, aale ni Eleasar obisuɔtɔbi, Eleasar nwu niale oletatɛ nɔɔfo Aaron obisuɔtɔbi nɛ. <verse eid="EZR 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 7:6" />Esra wɔ mmle lakata aakye Babel aawa Yerusalem. Asaatuotɛ wɔ niatofo ni Mose kufiofa nwu nwaa aale, n-ya di SAATE, Israel Yaa nwu, lata nii. Ɔka nwu latɔɔ lɛsaa biala aakaalɛ nwɔ nii, diekye SAATE Yaa nɔɔ kɔnɛɛ latika nwɔ di suoto. <verse eid="EZR 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 7:7" />Israel batii nwu bawo, diakyakaa ni di olebatatɛ, Lewi batii, sinu basantɛ, n-yoko banyuntɛ ku olekatakɔ bakpɛmblatɛ, kafɔɔ lakata baawa Yerusalem di Ɔka Artasasta lɛlɛɛ kuɛnsinle kamɛ.<verse eid="EZR 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 7:8" />Esra lalaabuo Yerusalem di Yuda batii kɔwɛntɛ nɔnle kamɛ di ɔka nwu sɛka ole lɛlɛɛ kuɛnsinle kamɛ. <verse eid="EZR 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 7:9" />Aakye osuku nɔɔ ɔkyɛ kasɔ di Babel di Yuda batii kɔwɛntɛ kasale dii kasale suoto, ni aalaabuo Yerusalem di kɔwɛntɛ nɔnle dii kasale suoto nɛ. Diekye Yaa nɔɔ sibualɛ kɔnɛɛ latika nwɔ di suoto. <verse eid="EZR 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 7:10" />Diekye Esra layɔ suoto nɔɔ aata SAATE nwu Kufiofa kamɛ obuo ku ololaa ole suoto, aatootuo kafɔɔ sɛsaabla ku afiofa nikũ di Israel.<verse eid="EZR 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kukũ Ko Di Ɔka Artasasta Lata Ni Esra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 7:11" />Nnya kukũ ko di Ɔka Artasasta lata ni oletatɛ Esra ku asaatuotɛ nwu, otii wɔ niatofo ni asaa di sɛlaa se niale ni SAATE nwu afiofa ku sɛsaabla nɔɔ siata ni Israel:<verse eid="EZR 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 7:12" />“Artasasta, baka ɔka,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 7:12" />
  <para style="pmc" vid="EZR 7:12">“Kuɔta ni Esra, Yaa wɔ di osi oletatɛ ku Kufiofa nwu asaatuotɛ:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 7:12" />
  <para style="pm" vid="EZR 7:12">“Kɔsɛɛsa fɔ.<verse eid="EZR 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 7:13" />“Nunua kokpee kufiofa nlɛ Israel batii lele di sɛka kalekɔ nii, di olebatatɛ ku Lewi batii nkyakaa ni, boomiɛ alɛ bakyɛ ni Yerusalem ku afɔ, kafuo ɔkyɛ. <verse eid="EZR 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 7:14" />Ɔka ku disibubatatɛ nɔɔ bakuɛnsĩ niekpee fɔ alɛ laawolaa asaa fakyeko Yuda ku Yerusalem suoto, di Yaa lɛfɔ Kufiofa ko ninsi fɔ ni ninnɛɛ kanya. <verse eid="EZR 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 7:15" />Diɛkyakaa ni yi, yɔ koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle ko di ɔka ku disibubatatɛ nɔɔ lata ni Israel Yaa ku otu fãa, nnwɔ kasiɛkɔ ninkpe ni di Yerusalem faklee, <verse eid="EZR 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 7:16" />diɛkyakaa ni di koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle ko kumuu fabawɛ fankyeko ni Babel kasɔ, ku batii nwu ku olebatatɛ otu-fãa asaaɔta diɛta ni Yaa lɛma olekatakɔ nwu di Yerusalem. <verse eid="EZR 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 7:17" />Ku koto ko mmle yi, nyu falɛ fɛɛya banankyue-suɔtɔ, akunumuu ku afosobi-suɔtɔ, diɛkyakaa ni di alesaa asaaɔta ku nta asaaɔta lɛma, faayɔ nya fata ole di Yaa lɛfɔ olekatakɔ oleɔta akyikye suoto di Yerusalem.<verse eid="EZR 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 7:18" />“Ni nfɛ biafuo lɛsaa lele di afɔ ku babilee Yuda batii bienyu bilɛ dilɛ nwaa dita ye ni ɔbla ku koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle bule nwu, di Yaa lee dibiesaa kanya. <verse eid="EZR 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 7:19" />Yɔ awansaa ya amuu beekpee fɔ ni ninnɛɛ fablako ɔkpɛ fata Yerusalem Yaa nwu diɛta ni kasumu di Yaa lɛfɔ olekatakɔ kamɛ. <verse eid="EZR 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 7:20" />Nse lɛsaa lewo lefĩ diɛta Yaa lɛfɔ olekatakɔ nwu di obe owo kamɛ alɛ faata ni yi, ni faafuo ni ɔta okyeko ɔka leyo koto lɛlakaa kamɛ.<verse eid="EZR 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 7:21" />“Nunua ami, Ɔka Artasasta lediki kanya nlɛ atobatɛtɛ ba bamuu ninkpe ni di Okle-Kamaa bata oletatɛ Esra, Yaa wɔ ninkpe ni di osi afiofa asaatuotɛ lɛsaa lele abakaalɛ ni di nimu kamɛ- <verse eid="EZR 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 7:22" />diɛlaadu koto fututu bakilo nkpe ntiɛ-alafa-ana, kamɔɔ bakilo nkpe lefosi, nta akuuku alafa akuɔ, nnɔnyi ataase alafa akuɔ, ku mmba kpinwu. <verse eid="EZR 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 7:23" />Lɛsaa lele di Yaa wɔ di osi letuo alɛ babla yi, ta babla ni di nimu kamɛ bata Yaa wɔ di osi olekatakɔ nwu. Obe oso di ɔblɔ nɔɔ yakayaka kawa di ɔka sɛka kalekɔ ku babi nɔɔ suoto? <verse eid="EZR 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 7:24" />Faatofo kafɔɔ falɛ fanaa osuku fantika akpooto, kɔsɔsĩ ee asaa basunsũtɛ koto ko manta ni abaa di olebatatɛ, Lewi batii, sinubasantɛ, n-yoko banyuntɛ, olekatakɔ bakpɛmblatɛ ee bakpɛmblatɛ bamba ba ninkpe ni di Yaa leyo le mmle kuonwii lɛma suoto.<verse eid="EZR 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 7:25" />“Ni afɔ, Esra, di Yaa lɛfɔ ninumbe le ninkpe fɔ ni kanya yi, diki bakantɛ-bisɔ ku bakantɛ-nɔɔfo baatoobuɛ sɛlaa batɔɔta Okle-Kamaa batii nwu bamuu- mba bamuu nin-ye ni Yaa lɛfɔ afiofa nwu. Faatuo kafɔɔ olele ninan-ye nya. <verse eid="EZR 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 7:26" />Otii lele ninanle Yaa lɛfɔ kufiofa nwu ku ɔka kufiofa nwu yi, nwaako dikpenii bɛɛnanfi nwɔ kootoko ku kukpi, otososa odiki di okpoo, lɛsaawɛ nɔɔ ofũ ninnɛɛ, ee baatɛ nwɔ di leyo katenkɔ.”<verse eid="EZR 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esra Latansa Yaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 7:27" />Baatansa SAATE nwu, bate loo Yaa wɔ niɛyɔ eekpee ni di ɔka otu kamɛ alɛ aata dibu nwa ni di SAATE nwu leyo di Yerusalem di osuku wɔ mmle suoto, <verse eid="EZR 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 7:28" />ku nnwɔ niele mi ni sibualɛ nɔɔ biene di ɔka ku disibubatatɛ nɔɔ ku ɔka banɔɔfotii finle nɔɔ bamuu anu. Ta SAATE Yaa nii kɔnɛɛ latika mi ni di suoto oso, lakpee okyiini lasiisa basuɔtɔ batunletɛ di Israel baakata baakyɛ ku ami.<verse eid="EZR 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EZR 8" />
  <para style="s1">Batii Ba Niakye Ni Sɛlanle Kamɛ Baawa Ni Ku Esra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 8:1" />Nnya ayo kamɛ banɔɔfo ku mba ayooto baakpana ni baakata baakye Babel baawa ni ku ami di Ɔka Artasasta sɛka olebee kamɛ:<verse eid="EZR 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 8:2" />Di Pinehas banantii kamɛ yi, Gersom;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 8:2">Itamar banantii kamɛ, Daniel;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 8:2">Dawid banantii kamɛ, Hatus, <verse eid="EZR 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 8:3" />niakye ni Sekania banantii kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 8:3" />
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 8:3">di Paros banantii kamɛ yi, Sakaria, baakpana basuɔtɔ kɔlafa afosi-anɔɔ ayooto baakyakaa di suoto nɔɔ;<verse eid="EZR 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 8:4" />di Pahat-Moab banantii kamɛ yi, Serahia obisuɔtɔbi Eliehoenai, di basuɔtɔ alafa-anyɔ lakyakaa ni ku nnwɔɔ;<verse eid="EZR 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 8:5" />di Satu banantii kamɛ yi, Yahasiel obisuɔtɔbi Sekania, di basuɔtɔ alafa-atiɛ lakyakaa ni ku nnwɔɔ;<verse eid="EZR 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 8:6" />di Adin banantii kamɛ, Yonatan obisuɔtɔbi Ebed, di basuɔtɔ afosi-anɔɔ lakyakaa ni ku nnwɔɔ;<verse eid="EZR 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 8:7" />di Elam banantii kamɛ, Atalia obisuɔtɔbi Yesaia, di basuɔtɔ afosi-akuɛnsĩ lakyakaa ni ku nnwɔɔ;<verse eid="EZR 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 8:8" />di Sefatia banantii kamɛ yi, Mikeal obisuɔtɔbi Sebadia, di basuɔtɔ afosi-anɛ lakyakaa ni ku nnwɔɔ;<verse eid="EZR 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 8:9" />di Yoab banantii kamɛ yi, Yehiel obisuɔtɔbi Obadia, di basuɔtɔ alafa anyɔ-lefosi-banɛ lakyakaa ni ku nnwɔɔ;<verse eid="EZR 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 8:10" />di Bani banantii kamɛ yi, Yosifia obisuɔtɔbi Selomit, di basuɔtɔ kɔlafa afosi-akuɔ lakyakaa ni ku nnwɔɔ;<verse eid="EZR 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 8:11" />di Bebai banantii kamɛ yi, Bebai obisuɔtɔbi Sakaria, di basuɔtɔ afosi-anyɔ-banɛ lakyakaa ni ku nnwɔɔ;<verse eid="EZR 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 8:12" />di Asgad banantii kamɛ yi, Hakatan obisuɔtɔbi Yahonan, di basuɔtɔ kɔlafa-lefosi lakyakaa ni ku nnwɔɔ;<verse eid="EZR 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 8:13" />di Adonikam banantii kamɛ yi, bayɛntɛle nwu, di ayooto lɛma niale ni Elifelet, Yeiel ku Semaia, di basuɔtɔ afosi-akuɔ lakyakaa ni ku mma;<verse eid="EZR 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 8:14" />di Bigwai banantii kamɛ yi, Utai ku Sabud, di basuɔtɔ afosi-akuɛnsĩ lakyakaa ni ku mma.<verse eid="EZR 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esra Lamiɛ Lewi Batii Aata Olekatakɔ Nwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 8:15" />Lasiisa ma di okle wɔ nimbiɛ kunfe ni Ahawa, ni buasiɛ ninfa ayi atiɛ nɛ. Obe wɔ lanyunyu ni batii nwu ku olebatatɛ nwu kamɛ yi, ntanya Lewi otii kuonwii ninfa. <verse eid="EZR 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 8:16" />Nioso lakpee baalɛɛ Eliesa, Ariel, Semaia, Elnatan, Yarib, Elnatan, Natan, Sakaria ku Mesulam, mba niale ni batunletɛ, ku Yoiarib ku Elnatan, mba niale ni basuɔtɔ ba niatofo ni akũ, <verse eid="EZR 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 8:17" />ni lakpee ma Ido nfũ, tunletɛ wɔ di Kasifia okpoo nɛ. Latɔkɔ ma ɔlaa wɔ baatɔkɔ ni Ido ku asaabaletɛ nɔɔ, olekatakɔ nwu bakpɛmblatɛ di Kasifia, di mmle baawako wo ni bakpɛntɛ munta ni Yaa loo leyo. <verse eid="EZR 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 8:18" />Ta Yaa loo sibualɛ kɔnɛɛ latika wo ni di suoto oso yi, baawako wo Serebia, osuɔtɔ wɔ niawɛ ni okyiini, aakye ni Mahli banantii kamɛ, aale ni Lewi obisuɔtɔbi, Israel obisuɔtɔbi, ku Serebia babisuɔtɔbi ku basuɔtɔ-bilɛma, baabla lefosi-banɛ; <verse eid="EZR 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 8:19" />ku Hasabia, diakyakaa ni ku Yesaia baakye ni Merari banantii kamɛ, ku basuɔtɔ-bilɛma ku bafa lɛma, baabla basuɔtɔ afosi-anyɔ. <verse eid="EZR 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 8:20" />Baawako kafɔɔ olekatakɔ bakpɛmblatɛ alafa-anyɔ-afosi-anyɔ. Bakpɛmblatɛ ba di Dawid ku banɔɔfotii nɔɔ lase baata alɛ baakyakaako ni Lewi batii nɛ. Baakpana bamuu lɛma ayooto di akũ kamɛ.<verse eid="EZR 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esra Laleko Batii Nwu Katũ Di Kanya Onii Ku Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Kamɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 8:21" />Ninfa, di Ahawa Okle lɔɔkɔ nwu, latɛ kanya onii, di mmle buawakosa ni suoto loo kasɔ di Yaa loo anu, munkaalɛ nwɔ ni kafɔɔ atoko ɔkyɛ ole osuku ɔkyɛ munta ni awo ku babi loo, ku lɛsaawɛ loo nimuu. <verse eid="EZR 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 8:22" />Sinunsɔ lakpɛ mi alɛ kakaalɛ ɔka nlɛ atɛɛ bakpɛtɛ ku bapɔnkɔ basiɛtɛ alɛ baafũ wo mankyeko balo loo nnɛɛ di osuku, diekye buatɔkɔ ɔka bulɛ, “Yaa loo sibualɛ ole kɔnɛɛ ntika di otii biala wɔ nintika nwɔ ni disi suoto, kafɔɔ ɔblɔ nɔɔ yakayaka n-wa di batii ba bamuu ninsĩ nwɔ ni suoto.” <verse eid="EZR 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 8:23" />Nioso buanii kanya ni buakaalɛ Yaa loo nle mmle suoto, ni aanu wo ɔlaa ɔpɛ ɔta nɛ.<verse eid="EZR 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asaaɔta Diɛta Ni Olekatakɔ Nwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 8:24" />Ninfɛ ladiki olebatatɛ banɔɔfo lefosi-banyɔ lase lete, diakyakaa ni ku Serebia, Hasabia ku basuɔtɔ-bilɛma lefosi nɛ, <verse eid="EZR 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 8:25" />ni laklapoosa koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle asaaɔta, awansaa ya di ɔka, disibubatatɛ nɔɔ, banɔɔfotii nɔɔ ku Israel omuu niawɛ ni ninfa lakũ baata ni Yaa loo leyo nwu lata ma nɛ. <verse eid="EZR 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 8:26" />Laklapoosa koto fututu bakilo nkpe afosi-anyɔ-nkpe-nnyɔ ku kɔlafa, koto fututu awansaa onutũ labla bakilo nkpe ntiɛ-alafa-ana, koto sɛɛle onutũ labla bakilo nkpe ntiɛ-alafa-ana, <verse eid="EZR 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 8:27" />koto sɛɛle abɛɛsibii afosi-anyɔ di kɔya nɔɔ labla ni bakilo banɛ ku ɔfã, ku abɔɔsaa biene kyɔlɔkyɔlɔ awansaa anyɔ, eefũ ni kɔya fɛ koto sɛɛle.<verse eid="EZR 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 8:28" />Ni latɔkɔ ma nlɛ, “Biɛbla Klekle fɛ mmle beekleklesa ni awansaa ya mmle bɛɛta ni SAATE nwu. Koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle nwu nle otu-fãa asaaɔta ɛɛta ni SAATE nwu, bawa lee Yaa nwu. <verse eid="EZR 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 8:29" />Bilolaa nya biklee nwaa dilaase di obe wɔ biɛklapoosa nya ni di SAATE nwu leyo ayo ya kaamɛ di Yerusalem di olebatatɛ banɔɔfo ku Lewi batii ku Israel ayo kamɛ banɔɔfo anu.” <verse eid="EZR 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 8:30" />Ninfɛ di olebatatɛ ku Lewi batii nwu lafũ koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle ku awansaa klekle ya baaklapoosa alɛ bayɔ basifiko ni Yaa loo leyo nwu di Yerusalem nɛ.<verse eid="EZR 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Batii Okple Osifi Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 8:31" />Di Yuda batii kɔwɛntɛ kasale lefosi dii nyɔɔfa kamɛ yi, buadie di Ahawa Okle bulɛ buosifi Yerusalem. Yaa loo kɔnɛɛ latika wo di suoto, ni aadiki wo aakyeko balo ku bayu nnɛɛ di osuku nɛ. <verse eid="EZR 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 8:32" />Nioso bualaabuo Yerusalem, nfa buatɛ ɔnyɛɛ ayi atiɛ nɛ. <verse eid="EZR 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 8:33" />Di dii naafa, di Yaa loo leyo kamɛ yi, buaklapoosa koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle ku awansaa klekle nwu buayɔ buakpee di Uria obisuɔtɔbi oletatɛ Meremot nnɛɛ. Pinehas obisuɔtɔbi Eleasar lawɛ ku nnwɔɔ, nkpo kafɔɔ di Lewi batii Yesua obisuɔtɔbi Yosabad ku Binui obisuɔtɔbi Noadia lawɛ ninfa nɛ. <verse eid="EZR 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 8:34" />Baabla nkuntaa di lɛsaa biala suoto baata di lɛpɔ́ ku onutũ kanya, ni baakpana onutũ omuu baatɛ di obe nwu nkpo kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="EZR 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 8:35" />Ninfɛ di balanle ba niakye ni sɛlanle kamɛ baawa ni lata ofiɛ asaaɔta baata Israel Yaa nwu nɛ: banankyue-suɔtɔ lefosi- banyɔ, akunumuu afosi-anaasĩ-akuɔ, afosobi-suɔtɔ afosi-akuɛnsĩ-bakuɛnsĩ di Israel omuu disi. Fɛ okpile asaaɔta kafɔɔ yi, ntiekpaa lefosi-nnyɔ. N-ya mmle amuu lale ofiɛ asaaɔta diata SAATE nwu. <verse eid="EZR 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 8:36" />Baayɔ ɔka afiofa nwu kafɔɔ baata ɔka leyo banɔɔfotii ku Okle-Kamaa abaa kanyabayilatɛ, ninfɛ baata batii nwu ku Yaa leyo nwu lɛkyakaako nɛ.<verse eid="EZR 8:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EZR 9" />
  <para style="s1">Esra Lanu Alɛ Israel Batii Kodiki Mba Ninanle Ni Yuda Batii Man-yɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 9:1" />Baaloo ni asaa ya mmle ɔbla sɛmaa yi, ni di batunletɛ nwu lawa ɔkyɛ nii baabatɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Israel batii, di olebatatɛ ku Lewi batii nkyakaa ni, diɛɛblasa suoto lɛma di batii ba ninsi bakaako ma ni ku ayududusaa lɛma ɔbla suoto, batii fɛle Kanaan batii, Heti batii, Perisi batii, Yebusi batii, Amon batii, Moab batii, Egipte batii ku Amori batii. <verse eid="EZR 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 9:2" />Batɔyɔ babisankobi lɛma bawo fɛ basɔfɔ bɛɛta suoto lɛma ku babisuɔtɔbi lɛma, bɛɛkpɔtɔɔsa kɔna klekle nwu ku batii nwu niɛmana ma beekyi nii. Batunletɛ nwu ku banɔɔfotii nwu kafɔɔ niele katũ di onukwale ɔtanle wɔ mmle kamɛ nɛ.”<verse eid="EZR 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 9:3" />Obe wɔ lanu ni nle mmle yi, labɛbɛɛ osi akpeele ku akpeele wua nii, lanananfi disi sinwini ku okusu nii, ni lataba kaasɔ di nnɛɛ lefee ku sɛnyaami owi kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="EZR 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 9:4" />Ninfɛ di otii biala wɔ nin-yɛkɛ ni Israel Yaa ɔlaa nwu labamana mi baakyi, ta balanle nwu onukwale ɔtanle wɔ mmle oso. Ni lasiɛ ninfa sɛnyaami kanya dialaaase di kɔtɔɔfɔ oleɔta bee nɛ.<verse eid="EZR 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esra Lapɛ Ɔlaa Di Mba Ninanle Ni Yuda Batii Kɔyɔ Disi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 9:5" />Ninfɛ di kɔtɔɔfɔ oleɔta bee yi, lataka di sikududu nii owi kamɛ, ku osi akpeele ku akpeele wua nii nwu bɛbɛɛle, ni lapɛ akunkyi lawii nnɛɛ nii lakyɔɔ SAATE Yaa nii <verse eid="EZR 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 9:6" />lapɛ ɔlaa nlɛ:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="EZR 9:6">“Oo Yaa nii, sinunsɔ kɔkpɛ mi osie kanya, konunsɔ kafɔɔ katakatɛsa anu nii nkyɔɔ fɔ nii, Yaa nii, diekye sikpile loo lɛtaka katoo silenke asi loo, lɛpɔɔ loo okpi kafɔɔ ntoodu osi. <verse eid="EZR 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 9:7" />Diayɔ ni di bawa loo obe diɛbase ni di miɛ, lɛpɔɔ loo okpi ntɔɔtɛ diɛpɔ̀. Ta sikpile loo oso yi, baayɔ awo ku baka loo ku olebatatɛ loo baata kapamii ku sɛlanle, kayu ku sinunsɔ okpee di bafɔɔ baka nnɛɛ, fɛ mmle dite ni miɛ dii le mmle.<verse eid="EZR 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 9:8" />“Kafɔɔ nunua, di obe kakui kamɛ yi, SAATE Yaa loo nwu ntoole wo sibualɛ eediɛ batii bawo ɛɛtɛ wo, ni ɛɛta wo lɛba biene di kakleklekɔ nɔɔ nɛ, nioso Yaa loo nta anu loo lɛkpa ku ɔnyɛɛ ɔtɛ kɛɛkɛɛ di sɛlanle loo osiɛ kamɛ. <verse eid="EZR 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 9:9" />Kuntɛ bule balanle yi, Yaa loo diediɛ wo di sɛlanle loo osiɛ kamɛ. Atootuo wo sifutulɛ nɔɔ di Persia baka anu: Atɔɔta wo nkpa fɔle alɛ buase Yaa loo leyo nwu letofo, munlolaa nlalaakɔ nini kafɔɔ, ni aanyu wo di Yuda ku Yerusalem nɛ.<verse eid="EZR 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 9:10" />“Oo Yaa loo, kafɔɔ kanunua, obe bubafuo obuɛ di nle mmle sɛmaa? Diekye butoosĩ kufiofa nwu <verse eid="EZR 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 9:11" />faata faafenko ni di bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ Yaa ɔlaa babuɛtɛtɛ nwu suoto di obe wɔ faabuɛ ni falɛ: Kasɔ ka biobuo minaayɔ ni nle kasɔ ka niɛlalaa ni di batii nwu kalalaa sɛsaabla kamɛ. Di ayududusaa sɛsaabla lɛma kamɛ beyiisa kasɔ nwu ku asaa lɛma nwu ninanklekle ni diɛyɔ ni di kayɛntɛkɔ kanwii diɛlaase ni di kayɛntɛkɔ bamba. <verse eid="EZR 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 9:12" />Nninkpo oso, bitan-yɔ babisankobi lee biata babisuɔtɔbi lɛma layɔ ee bifũ babisankobi lɛma biata babisuɔtɔbi lee baayɔ. Bitankaalɛ basiɛwo onwii ɔbla kanya ninii ku mma di obe kuonwii kamɛ, di mmle biawɛ osie minle ni kasɔ nwu asaa biene, mimbu nya mintɛ ni babi lee kafɔɔ fɛ atesaa ya ninaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="EZR 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 9:13" />“Lɛsaa le niɛta diɛwa wo ni di suoto nkpo ninle sɛsaabla kpile loo ku lɛpɔɔ kplɛ loo okpi oso, kafɔɔ yi, Yaa loo, fatɔɔnaanfi wo kootoko diɛwakasɔ dilenke mmle diesiɛko ni sikpile loo, ni fɛɛta otii owo lebu asi nkpa fɛle mmle nɛ. <verse eid="EZR 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 9:14" />Buakple munwaalɛ afiofa lɛfɔ nwu muntoodiki bawo muntɔɔyɔ ku batii nwu nimbla ni ayududusaa nwu okle? Ɔblɔ dilɔbasii fɔ ofiɛ di suoto loo fawɔɔsa wo, alɛ flɔbabu otii kuonwii ninkpe ni nkpa ee nnwɔ ninkasiɛ ni nkpa fatɛ wo? <verse eid="EZR 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 9:15" />Oo SAATE, Israel Yaa, fate tinini! Beediɛ wo miɛ dii le mmle fɛ batii ba niebu basi ni nkpa. Buyɛ di anu lɛfɔ di lɛpɔɔ okpi loo kamɛ, kuntɛ nninkpo oso, kuonwii loo dilɔbafuo oyila di anu lɛfɔ.”<verse eid="EZR 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EZR 10" />
  <para style="s1">Batii Nwu Ladiki Sikple Lɛma Baabuɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 10:1" />Di obe wɔ di Esra latɔɔpɛ ni ɔlaa aatoodiki sikpile aatoobuɛ, aatoowi, aatɔɔpɛpɛɛ ni suoto nɔɔ kaasɔ di Yaa leyo nwu anu yi, Israel batii dikudi kplɛ ninwii- basuɔtɔ, basanko ku babisɔ- lamana nwɔ baakyi. Mma kafɔɔ baawi osie kanya. <verse eid="EZR 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 10:2" />Ninfɛ di Yehiel obisuɔtɔbi Sekania, Elam banantii onwii lɛma, latɔkɔ Esra alɛ, “Butale onukwale buata Yaa loo ku bafɔɔ basanko ba buayɔ buakyeko ni batii ba niɛmana wo beekyi ni nfũ. Kafɔɔ di nle mmle sɛmaa yi, osuku onyu lekple kukpe kuɔta Israel. <verse eid="EZR 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 10:3" />Nunua yi, bita bubla kanya ninii di Yaa loo anu alɛ buatososa basanko ba mmle ku babi lɛma bamuu mansifi, di saate nii kɔkà ku mba nin-yɛkɛ ni Yaa loo afiofa kanya. Bita babla ni di Kufiofa nwu kanya. <verse eid="EZR 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 10:4" />Taka; diekye ɔlaa wɔ mmle nsi fɔ ninnɛɛ. Bubayila fɔ kamaa, nioso wɛ osie, faabla nkpo.”<verse eid="EZR 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 10:5" />Nioso Esra lataka ni aayɔ olebatatɛ-nɔɔfo ku Lewi batunletɛ ku Israel batii bamuu aakpee di ntam kalɔ alɛ babla di ɔlaa wɔ bɛɛtɔkɔ nwɔ ni suoto nɛ. Ni baaka ntam nwu nɛ. <verse eid="EZR 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 10:6" />Ninfɛ di Esra ladie di Yaa leyo nwu aasifi Eliasib obisuɔtɔbi Yehohanan leyo nɛ. Di obe wɔ aawɛ ni ninfa, atale alesaa kuanwii, anyi ntu kunwii, diekye aakple aatoowi di balanle nwu onukwale ɔtanle suoto.<verse eid="EZR 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Disibu Diɛta Ni Bawo Ɔyɔ Ɔkpɔkpɔtɔɔsa Kase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 10:7" />Ni baayie lɛkya di Yuda ku Yerusalem omuu alɛ balanle nwu bamuu babasi di Yerusalem nɛ. <verse eid="EZR 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 10:8" />Otii lele niesĩ ɔwa di ayi atiɛ kamɛ kamayu lɛsaawɛ nɔɔ nimuu, di banɔɔfotii ku okpoo banɔɔfo nwu kɔkpaa didikibi kanya, mandiki otii nwu omu kafɔɔ di balanle nwu dikudi kamɛ.<verse eid="EZR 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 10:9" />Di ayi atiɛ nwu kamɛ yi, Yuda ku Benyamin basuɔtɔ bamuu labasi di Yerusalem. Di Yuda batii kɔwɛntɛ naasinle di dii afosi-anyɔ suoto, batii nwu bamuu lasisiɛ di Yaa leyo kaflɔnkɔ nwu anu, di lɛyɛkɛ kplɛ ku dii nwu kanto oso. <verse eid="EZR 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 10:10" />Ninfɛ di oletatɛ Esra lataka aayila aabuɛ aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Bieele onukwale; biɛyɔ bafɔɔ basanko biɛkyakaa di Israel lɛpɔɔ okpi suoto. <verse eid="EZR 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 10:11" />Nunua bidiki sikpile bibuɛ bitɔkɔ SAATE nwu, bate lee Yaa nwu, biɛbla dibiesaa nɔɔ. Biblasa suoto lee di batii ba niɛmana ye beekyi ni ku bafɔɔ-sɔfɔ lee nwu suoto.”<verse eid="EZR 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 10:12" />Ni di dikudi nwu nimuu latuna ku sɛlɔ siene alɛ: “Ole-fɔ nkpe! Dikpe ni buɔbla fɛ mmle feebuɛ nii. <verse eid="EZR 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 10:13" />Kafɔɔ batii kpinwu nkpe ninfũ, kanto ɔnɔɔ-bee kafɔɔ dile; nioso bulɔbafuo oyila kaayi. Diɛkyakaa ni yi, ɔlaa wɔ mmle dilɔbafuo ose di dii ninwii ee ayi anyɔ kamɛ, diekye butɔɔbla okpile kplɛ di nle mmle kamɛ. <verse eid="EZR 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 10:14" />Nioso bita banɔɔfotii loo badiki kɔkpaa bata kasikɔ nwu kamuu. Ni biɛta otii biala di sekpoo loo kamɛ ɛɛyɔ ni ɔfɔɔ-sanko awa di obe wɔ bɛɛtɛ ni kamɛ, diɛkyakaa ni di okpoo biala banɔɔfo ku bakantɛ, dilaase di obe wɔ di Yaa loo ɔblɔ yakayaka nwu di ɔlaa wɔ mmle suoto kamataka wo ni di suoto.” <verse eid="EZR 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 10:15" />Asahel obisuɔtɔbi Yonatan ku Tikwa obisuɔtɔbi Yaseia, di Mesulam ku Sabetai, Lewi otii nwu layila ma ni kamaa lete niale batii ba niataka baayila ni di ɔlaa wɔ mmle suoto nɛ.<verse eid="EZR 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 10:16" />Nioso balanle nwu labla fɛ mmle baabuɛ nii. Ni di oletatɛ Esra ladiki basuɔtɔ ba niale ni ayo kamɛ banɔɔfo, di leyo kamɛ biala otii onwii, bamuu lɛma di ayooto lɛma kanya. Baasiɛ baabuo di sɛlaa nwu kamɛ di Yuda batii kɔwɛntɛ fosile dii kasale suoto, <verse eid="EZR 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 10:17" />ni baaloo bamuu ɔkpɛ ɔblako di Yuda batii kɔwɛntɛ kasale dii kasale suoto di basuɔtɔ ba niayɔ ni bafɔɔ-sanko suoto nɛ.<verse eid="EZR 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Basuɔtɔ Ba Niayɔ Ni Bafɔɔ-sɔfɔ</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 10:18" />Di olebatatɛ banantii nwu kamɛ yi, batii ba mmle niayɔ bafɔɔ-sanko nɛ:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 10:18" />
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 10:18">Di Yosadak obisuɔtɔbi Yesua banantii kamɛ, ku babilɛma-suɔtɔbi kamɛ yi: Maaseia, Eliesa, Yarib ku Gedalia. <verse eid="EZR 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 10:19" />(Bamuu lɛma laka ntam alɛ babadiɛ basɔfɔ lɛma nwu, ni di lɛpɔɔ okpi lɛma kafɔɔ yi, obiala lata dikunumuu ninwii, ninwii baakyeko bafoso kamɛ fɛ lɛpɔɔ okpi asaaɔta.)<verse eid="EZR 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 10:20" />Di Imer banantii kamɛ yi:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:20">Hanani ku Sebadia.<verse eid="EZR 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 10:21" />Di Harim banantii kamɛ yi:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:21">Maaseia, Elia, Semaia, Yehiel ku Usia.<verse eid="EZR 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 10:22" />Di Pashur banantii kamɛ yi:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:22">Eliehoenai, Maaseia, Ismael, Netanel, Yosabad ku Elasa.<verse eid="EZR 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 10:23" />Di Lewi batii kamɛ yi:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 10:23" />
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:23">Yosabad, Simei, Kelaia (ninle ni, Kelita), Petahia, Yuda ku Elieser.<verse eid="EZR 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 10:24" />Di sinu basantɛ kamɛ yi:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:24">Eliasib.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 10:24">Di n-yoko banyuntɛ kamɛ yi:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:24">Salum, Telem ku Uri.<verse eid="EZR 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 10:25" />Di Israel batii bamba kamɛ kafɔɔ:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 10:25" />
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 10:25">Di Paros banantii kamɛ yi:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:25">Ramia, Yisia, Malkiya, Miyamin, Eleasar, Malkiya ku Benaia.<verse eid="EZR 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 10:26" />Di Elam banantii kamɛ yi:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:26">Matania, Sakaria, Yehiel, Abdi Yeremot ku Elia.<verse eid="EZR 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 10:27" />Di Satu banantii kamɛ yi:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:27">Eliehoenai, Eliasib, Matania, Yeremot, Sabad ku Asisa.<verse eid="EZR 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 10:28" />Di Bebai banantii kamɛ yi:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:28">Yehohanan, Hanania, Sabai ku Atlai.<verse eid="EZR 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 10:29" />Di Bani banantii kamɛ yi:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:29">Mesulam, Maluk, Adaia, Yasub, Seal ku Yeremot.<verse eid="EZR 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 10:30" />Di Pahat-Moab banantii kamɛ yi:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:30">Adna, Kelal, Benaia, Maaseia, Matania, Besalel, Binui ku Manase.<verse eid="EZR 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 10:31" />Di Harim banantii kamɛ yi:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:31">Eliesa, Yissia, Malkiya, Semaia, Simeon, <verse eid="EZR 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 10:32" />Benyamin, Maluk, ku Semaria.<verse eid="EZR 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 10:33" />Di Hasum banantii kamɛ yi:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:33">Matenai, Matata, Sabad, Elifelet, Yeremai, Manase ku Simei.<verse eid="EZR 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 10:34" />Di Bani banantii kamɛ yi:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:34">Maadai, Amram, Uel, <verse eid="EZR 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 10:35" />Benaia, Bedeia, Keluhi, <verse eid="EZR 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 10:36" />Wania, Meremot, Eliasib, <verse eid="EZR 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZR 10:37" />Matania, Matenai ku Yaasau.<verse eid="EZR 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZR 10:38" />Di Binui banantii kamɛ yi:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:38">Simei, <verse eid="EZR 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZR 10:39" />Selemia, Natan, Adaia, <verse eid="EZR 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZR 10:40" />Maknadebai, Sasai, Sarai, <verse eid="EZR 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZR 10:41" />Asarel, Selemia, Semaria, <verse eid="EZR 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZR 10:42" />Salum, Amaria ku Yosef.<verse eid="EZR 10:42" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZR 10:43" />Di Nebo banantii kamɛ yi:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:43">Yeiel, Matitia, Sabad, Sebina, Yadai, Yoel ku Benaia.<verse eid="EZR 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZR 10:44" />Mba mmle bamuu niayɔ bafɔɔ-sanko, di bawo lalofo ni babi ku basɔfɔ lɛma nwu nɛ.<verse eid="EZR 10:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 10" />
</usx>